/T (In collaboration with the Raymond M. Alf Museum of Paleontology, our team developed an educational game centered on Baby Joe, a young Parasaurolophus. The game allows players to guide Baby Joe through key stages of growth and survival, making decisions about food, habitat, migration, and predator avoidance. The project introduces users to dinosaur biology, environmental challenges, and scientific thinking in an engaging format to be widely accessible. )
/E (In collaboration with the Raymond M. Alf Museum of Paleontology, our team developed an educational game centered on Baby Joe, a young Parasaurolophus. The game allows players to guide Baby Joe through key stages of growth and survival, making decisions about food, habitat, migration, and predator avoidance. The project introduces users to dinosaur biology, environmental challenges, and scientific thinking in an engaging format to be widely accessible. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [14]
>>
