/T (We have a longstanding tradition of hosting the Southern California League E. This year, we hosted Meets 0, 1, 2, and 3 at the Webb Schools. In addition to handling setup, cleanup, parking management, refereeing, and serving as MCs, we also actively engaged with our local community. We participated in scrimmages and invited local teams to visit our lab, offering them the opportunity to practice and learn from our engineering processes. Also providing us with the unique opportunity to showcase FTC to our school. We mentored newer teams during these events to guidance on strategy, design, and programming.)
