/T (Our intake process has proven highly efficient for collecting game elements from the field. Earlier in the season, we experimented with a servo-powered intake on linear rails; however, we encountered challenges with optimizing servo power and intake speed. Consequently, we reverted to a larger, motor-powered intake with a passive alignment system that reliably transfers elements to our end effector, resulting in faster overall cycle times and higher reliability. )
