/E (This is our second year using Pedro Pathing, and after gaining experience last season, we are confident it remains the right choice for our team. However, we did encounter some challenges. Unlike Road Runner, which uses time-based path execution, Pedro Pathing's distance-based approach occasionally caused paths to run longer than expected. To address this, we implemented path timeouts to ensure consistent cycle times. We also improved localization accuracy by fusing vision-based localization with Pinpoint dead wheel odometry, resulting in more reliable and precise autonomous routines.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
