/Title (Facing inconsistencies with our previous iterations of an active intakes, we pivoted towards designing a mechanism it closer to the ground in verison 3. Our design utilizes a counter banded set of compliant wheels. By avoiding having to transfer artifacts from the ground up a high distance into robot storing area, our intake has became much more consistent and effective while demanding less torque on intake.)
