3482 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our intake process has proven highly efficient for collecting game elements from the field. Earlier in the season, we experimented with a servo-powered intake on linear rails; however, we encountered challenges with optimizing servo power and intake speed. Consequently, we reverted to a larger, motor-powered intake with a passive alignment system that reliably transfers elements to our end effector, resulting in faster overall cycle times and higher reliability.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3441 0 R
/Prev 3481 0 R
>>
